# ResQher — Unified Dark Mode Color System Proposal

## Project Overview

**ResQher** is a women's safety mobile app (React Native / Expo Router) with these key screens:

| Screen | File | Current State |
|---|---|---|
| **SOS / Home** | [sos_screen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/(tabs)/sos_screen.tsx) | Map + SOS button + bottom nav. Light mode, white bg |
| **Login** | [login.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/(auth)/login.tsx) | Auth form with lavender gradient shell |
| **Signup** | [signup.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/(auth)/signup.tsx) | Multi-step form with progress tracker |
| **Auth Shell** | [AuthShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/components/auth/AuthShell.tsx) | Neutral gradient bg + decorative circles |
| **Explore** | [explore.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/(tabs)/explore.tsx) | Default Expo template (placeholder) |

**Design System Files:**
- [theme.ts](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/src/constants/theme.ts) — Colors `T`, Radius `R`, Spacing `S`, Typography `Ty`, Shadows [Sh](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/components/auth/AuthShell.tsx#14-58)
- [gradients.ts](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/src/constants/gradients.ts) — Gradient presets `G`

---

## Current vs. Proposed Direction

> [!WARNING]
> The current theme is **entirely Light Mode** (white backgrounds, light grays, lavender tints). The designer recommends a **Dark Mode-only "Tactical"** interface per NFR-007 (high-contrast emergency UI). This is a significant visual overhaul.

---

## Proposed Unified Color Palette

The palette below is designed to be a **single source of truth** across every screen in the app — auth, SOS, evidence vault, volunteer feed, and map.

### Core Backgrounds & Surfaces

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `bg` | `#0D0D0F` | True black base — deepest layer |
| `bgElevated` | `#121214` | Primary screen background (NFR-007 reference `#121212`) |
| `surface` | `#1A1A1E` | Cards, modals, bottom sheets |
| `surfaceLight` | `#222228` | Elevated cards, active list items |
| `surfaceGlass` | `rgba(26,26,30,0.85)` | Glassmorphism overlays (Evidence Vault, headers) |
| `surfaceOverlay` | `rgba(75,0,130,0.08)` | Subtle brand tint on glass surfaces |

### Brand — Deep Purple

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` | `#4B0082` | **Primary brand** — the designer's chosen Deep Purple |
| `brandLight` | `#7B2FBE` | Hover/focus states, secondary buttons |
| `brandMuted` | `rgba(75,0,130,0.25)` | Subtle backgrounds, active nav tint |
| `brandGlow` | `rgba(75,0,130,0.40)` | Pulsing map marker, scanning rings |
| `violet` | `#A855F7` | Accent highlights, gradient ends, CTA shimmer |
| `violetDark` | `#9333EA` | Button gradient dark end |

### Tactical Status Colors

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `danger` | `#E23636` | **Safety Red** — Police marker, SOS LIVE state |
| `dangerDark` | `#BE123C` | Pressed danger states |
| `dangerGlow` | `rgba(226,54,54,0.35)` | SOS pulse rings (live) |
| `warning` | `#F59E0B` | **Gold** — Volunteer markers |
| `warningDark` | `#D97706` | Pressed warning states |
| `success` | `#10B981` | Connection established, safe zone |
| `successGlow` | `rgba(16,185,129,0.30)` | "Secure connection" animation |
| `info` | `#3B82F6` | ETA badges, distance indicators |

### Text Hierarchy (on dark)

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `ink` | `#F5F5F7` | Primary headings — near-white |
| `ink2` | `#D1D1D6` | Body text |
| `ink3` | `#8E8E93` | Secondary / muted text |
| `ink4` | `#636366` | Placeholders, disabled labels |
| `ink5` | `#48484A` | Ghost text, ultra-muted |

### Borders & Dividers

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `line` | `#2C2C2E` | Subtle dividers |
| `lineMid` | `#3A3A3C` | Input borders, card outlines |
| `lineBold` | `#48484A` | Stronger separation |
| `lineBrand` | `rgba(75,0,130,0.30)` | Active/focused input borders |

### Map-Specific

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `mapBg` | Dark Grayscale Style | Silver/charcoal base, all POIs hidden |
| `markerVictim` | `#4B0082` | Pulsing Deep Purple dot |
| `markerPolice` | `#E23636` | Safety Red |
| `markerVolunteer` | `#F59E0B` | Gold |
| `markerUser` | `#A855F7` | Violet for "you are here" |

