## Gradient Presets

| Name | Colors | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `brandGradient` | `#4B0082 → #7B2FBE` | Primary CTA buttons, nav active pill |
| `sosIdle` | `#4B0082 → #A855F7` | SOS button resting state |
| `sosLive` | `#E23636 → #BE123C` | SOS button active/live |
| `authBg` | `#0D0D0F → #121214` | Auth screen background |
| `surfaceTint` | `#1A1A1E → #222228` | Card fills |
| `scanningRing` | `rgba(75,0,130,0.40) → rgba(75,0,130,0)` | Scanning animation radial fade |

