## Per-Screen Color Application

### 1. Tactical Map (SOS Home)
- **Background:** `bgElevated` (#121214)
- **Map style:** Dark Grayscale — all POIs hidden
- **Markers:** Victim = pulsing `brand`, Police = `danger`, Volunteers = `warning`
- **Header bar:** `surfaceGlass` with `surfaceOverlay` tint
- **SOS Button:** `sosIdle` gradient (idle) → `sosLive` gradient (active)
- **Pulse rings:** `brandGlow` (idle) → `dangerGlow` (live)

### 2. SOS Active Screen
- **Background:** `bgElevated`
- **Status header:** "HELP IS ON THE WAY" in `ink` on `surface` card
- **Cancel button:** Slide-to-cancel on `danger` with `ink` text
- **Quick actions:** Glass pills with `danger` (Call Police) and `brand` (Evidence Vault) icons
- **Chat preview (30%):** `surface` card with `lineMid` border

### 3. Evidence Vault
- **Background:** `bgElevated`
- **Cards:** `surfaceGlass` with glassmorphism blur
- **Media grid:** `surface` thumbnails, `lineMid` borders
- **"Encrypted" labels:** `success` text + lock icon
- **Audio waveform:** `brand` wave on `surface` background
- **Recording state:** Pulsing `danger` dot + "REC" label

### 4. Volunteer Incident Feed
- **Background:** `bgElevated`
- **SOS Cards:** `surface` bg, `lineMid` border
- **Distance/ETA badges:** `info` bg pill
- **Incident type chip:** `danger` for harassment, `warning` for general
- **Accept button:** Full-width `brandGradient` — the brightest element on screen
- **Mission view:** Map 70% + chat 30%, same tactical map style

### 5. Auth (Login / Signup)
- **Background:** `authBg` gradient (very dark)
- **Cards:** `surface` with `lineMid` border
- **Inputs:** `surfaceLight` bg, `lineMid` border → `lineBrand` on focus
- **CTA button:** `brandGradient`
- **Logo icon:** `brand` on `surfaceLight` circle
- **Decorative circles:** `brandMuted` instead of current lavender

---

## Visual Hierarchy Summary

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              BRIGHTNESS SCALE                │
│                                              │
│  ████  BRIGHTEST — Safety Red (#E23636)      │
│  ████  HIGH      — Gold (#F59E0B)            │
│  ████  PRIMARY   — Deep Purple (#4B0082)     │
│  ████  ACCENT    — Violet (#A855F7)          │
│  ████  INFO      — Blue (#3B82F6)            │
│  ████  SUCCESS   — Emerald (#10B981)         │
│  ░░░░  TEXT      — Near-white (#F5F5F7)      │
│  ░░░░  MUTED     — Gray (#8E8E93)            │
│  ▓▓▓▓  SURFACE   — Dark card (#1A1A1E)       │
│  ████  BASE      — Near-black (#121214)      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key design principle:** On the dark tactical interface, only **actionable elements** should be colorful. The background and surfaces stay dark/neutral so that markers, buttons, and status indicators "pop" with maximum contrast per NFR-007.

---

## Migration Considerations

> [!CAUTION]
> This is a **full theme overhaul** from Light → Dark. Every screen file that references `T.*` colors will need updates. The approach should be:
> 1. Update [theme.ts](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/src/constants/theme.ts) and [gradients.ts](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/src/constants/gradients.ts) with the new dark palette
> 2. Update [AuthShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/components/auth/AuthShell.tsx) (remove light gradient, add dark background)
> 3. Update [sos_screen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/%28tabs%29/sos_screen.tsx) styles (all white → dark surface colors)
> 4. Update [login.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/%28auth%29/login.tsx) / [signup.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/%28auth%29/signup.tsx) form styles
> 5. Update [_layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rinto/ResQher_app/app/resqher-mobile/app/_layout.tsx) StatusBar from `dark` → `light` (for light text on dark bg)
> 6. Add tactical map JSON style (dark grayscale, POIs hidden)

This should be done **incrementally per screen** to avoid regressions.
